        {
          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "By faith we understand that the universe has been framed by the word of God, so that what is seen has not been made out of things which are visible.",
      "ko": "믿음으로 모든 세계가 하나님의 말씀으로 지어진 줄을 우리가 아나니 보이는 것은 나타난 것으로 말미암아 된것이 아니니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a7c9d0e516cd7dbf7155719978cb9e327ccf95b3a60a753d86f9116a839232ee",
      "translation_text_hash": "014d03c11e4913c385495a4f5e1c702d529b74b40309ffcdaeaeb67653406c4d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
