      ],
      "en": "By faith Abraham, when he was called, obeyed to go out to the place which he was to receive for an inheritance. He went out, not knowing where he went.",
      "ko": "믿음으로 아브라함은 부르심을 받았을 때에 순종하여 장래 기업으로 받을 땅에 나갈쌔 갈 바를 알지 못하고 나갔으며",
      "source_text_hash": "3ad93d3c327d7b7b138801e3bc31667b0cefd1f529cf15dc4c92d03a71089ba2",
      "translation_text_hash": "5c2f95fb4b2953bffdd07700f58404fbe69718edd618838364f755f833212ef3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
