      ],
      "en": "For he was looking for the city which has foundations, whose builder and maker is God.",
      "ko": "이는 하나님의 경영하시고 지으실 터가 있는 성을 바랐음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "265808e33978ae7964f50cf0df67e42c57bcfb587172a857927fc8c48afc1638",
      "translation_text_hash": "33b9ff7b24d904bf5bd4d34b45dd3a3555fc709fcfa54491c308bd45435fd788",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
