          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "By faith even Sarah herself received power to conceive, and she bore a child when she was past age, since she counted him faithful who had promised.",
      "ko": "믿음으로 사라 자신도 나이 늙어 단산하였으나 잉태하는 힘을 얻었으니 이는 약속하신 이를 미쁘신줄 앎이라",
      "source_text_hash": "002d536b5fed24570c4a442a8bc996cca8cc1aac6d258545f9ec66d42e320da1",
      "translation_text_hash": "25f56d3e0492b228e904b444c33c8950631239c952c15a3d9bcb50cc51b1c6ef",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
