      "en": "By faith Rahab the prostitute didn’t perish with those who were disobedient, having received the spies in peace.",
      "ko": "믿음으로 기생 라합은 정탐군을 평안히 영접하였으므로 순종치 아니한 자와 함께 멸망치 아니하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "42bbcedf02a9b7c2f20c33812ea96b8f41c73d7c6f8f86f4eaa83c6427e5308c",
      "translation_text_hash": "28fdfb3da39b20b4322992c8dd2861748bf2dc15a7910fe974f7c3ce4903430b",
